{"case_id":"T8003","gap_exists":true,"gap_type":["format-specific seed corpus","compression configuration","input semantics"],"confidence":99,"affected_functions":["cab_read_header","cab_read_ahead_cfdata","cab_read_ahead_cfdata_lzx","lzx_decode_init","lzx_translation","lzx_cleanup_bitstream","lzx_decode","lzx_read_pre_tree","lzx_read_bitlen","lzx_make_huffman_table"],"reason":"H0 enables all formats and reaches archive payload decoding through archive_read_data_block, but its files[] corpus contains no CAB image. Its mutation strategy only changes fewer than 1% of bytes in existing non-CAB archives, so it does not materially exercise a structurally valid CAB whose CFFOLDER selects COMPTYPE_LZX and supplies the stateful LZX bitstream, Huffman tables, window sizes, block types, repeated offsets, and cross-CFDATA behavior introduced in S1.","evidence":["H0 calls archive_read_support_format_all(a), archive_read_open_memory(a, image, size), archive_read_next_header(a, &ae), and archive_read_data_block(a, &blk, &blk_size, &blk_offset), so the general read API is covered.","Every named element of H0's files[] is ISO, LZH, tar/bzip2/gzip/xz, ZIP, ar, cpio/RPM, or mtree; no .cab or other CAB seed is present.","H0 restores each existing rawimage and mutates numbytes = rand() % (size / 100), making generation of the required MSCF/CAB structure and coherent CFFOLDER, CFFILE, and CFDATA relationships implausible.","S1 adds a COMPTYPE_LZX branch in cab_read_ahead_cfdata that invokes cab_read_ahead_cfdata_lzx.","cab_read_header derives folder->comptype and folder->compdata from CFFOLDER_typeCompress; lzx_decode_init accepts compdata window widths from SLOT_BASE 15 through SLOT_MAX 21.","lzx_decode contains numerous input-driven states, including ST_RD_BLOCK_TYPE, ST_RD_R0, ST_RD_ALIGNED_OFFSET, ST_MAIN_TREE_256, ST_LENGTH, ST_OFFSET, and ST_COPY, spanning multiple calls and CFDATA blocks."],"recommended_action":"Add valid CAB seeds using COMPTYPE_LZX, covering window widths 15 through 21, VERBATIM_BLOCK, ALIGNED_OFFSET_BLOCK, UNCOMPRESSED_BLOCK, translation data, repeated offsets, multiple CFDATA records, truncation boundaries, and malformed Huffman bit-length encodings; retain the existing archive_read_next_header/archive_read_data_block consumption loop."}
